{"sequence":30,"timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:03:31.808112960Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-2-5f3aaec6","body":"Fix TUI test `rejects_invalid_integer_counts` in `crates/tank_tui/src/screens/actions.rs:540`. Adding `TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings` to the `ALL` array shifted action indices: `AddShrimp` moved from index 5 to index 6. The test calls `select_next_action()` 5 times expecting to land on `AddShrimp` but now lands on `CleanFilter`, causing the assertion to fail because `CleanFilter` accepts a float `intensity` and submits successfully instead of rejecting. Change the loop from `for _ in 0..5` to `for _ in 0..6`, or better, navigate by matching `ActionKind::AddShrimp` directly to avoid fragility.","dedup_key":"e73176d0db6d232b0f8671f84cefa1a6e73862fd957e1d11c72c6c86cebf04bd","run_id":"run-20260328125535","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
{"sequence":31,"timestamp":"2026-03-28T14:03:31.817878397Z","event_type":"amendment_queued","details":{"amendment_id":"fr-2-d613a3c7","body":"In save migration `migrate_v4_to_v5` (crates/tank_core/src/save.rs:555-568), `TrimPlants` is mapped to `TrimPlantsAndRemove`, but the original `TrimPlants` behavior routed biomass to fine_detritus (identical to `TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings`). This silently changes gameplay for saves with queued trim actions: biomass that would have stayed in the tank now exits the system. Either (a) map `TrimPlants` → `TrimPlantsAndLeaveCuttings` to preserve original behavior, or (b) add a comment documenting this as an intentional behavior upgrade and update the migration test name to reflect it is a deliberate semantic change, not a simple rename.","dedup_key":"b41b4cb477a9e350f823c6832d65316620731d5763f549de25902c183bb9e7ab","run_id":"run-20260328125535","source":"workflow_stage","source_stage":"final_review"}}
